[22.690821, "o", "Sheet names: ['Task', 'Data']\r\n\r\n=== TASK SHEET ===\r\nDimensions: A1:L41\r\n\r\nRow 9 (group labels):\r\n  Col 1 (A): Sample Group:\r\n  Col 3 (C): Control\r\n  Col 4 (D): Control\r\n  Col 5 (E): Control\r\n  Col 6 (F): Control\r\n  Col 7 (G): Control\r\n  Col 8 (H): Treated\r\n  Col 9 (I): Treated\r\n  Col 10 (J): Treated\r\n  Col 11 (K): Treated\r\n  Col 12 (L): Treated\r\n\r\nRow 10 (sample names):\r\n  Col 1 (A): Protein_ID\r\n  Col 2 (B): Gene_Symbol\r\n  Col 3 (C): NCIH1568_LUNG_TenPx15\r\n"]
