[115.058366, "o", "Adding formulas to Task sheet...\r\n\r\nStep 1: Adding expression lookup formulas (C11:L20)\r\n  Sample formula at C11: =INDEX(Data!$A$1:$BA$201,MATCH($A11,Data!$A:$A,0),MATCH(C$10,Data!$1:$1,0))\r\n"]
[115.058586, "o", "  Added formulas to cells C11:L20\r\n\r\nStep 2: Adding statistics formulas (B24:K27)\r\n"]
[115.058619, "o", "  Sample formulas for column B (protein row 11):\r\n    B24 Control Mean: =AVERAGE(C11:G11)\r\n    B25 Control StdDev: =STDEV(C11:G11)\r\n    B26 Treated Mean: =AVERAGE(H11:L11)\r\n    B27 Treated StdDev: =STDEV(H11:L11)\r\n"]
[115.058814, "o", "  Added formulas to cells B24:K27\r\n\r\nStep 3: Adding fold change formulas (A32:D41)\r\n"]
[115.05887, "o", "  Sample formulas for row 32 (protein 1):\r\n    A32: =A11\r\n    B32: =B11\r\n    C32 (Fold Change): =POWER(2,D32)\r\n    D32 (Log2 FC): =B26-B24\r\n"]
[115.058954, "o", "  Added formulas to cells A32:D41\r\n"]
[115.270291, "o", "\r\nWorkbook saved successfully!\r\n"]
